---
import DocLayout from "../layouts/DocLayout.astro";
---

<DocLayout title="Support" description="Get help with Styleum: answers to common questions and how to reach support." kicker="Help" intro="We're here to help! Find answers to common questions or reach out to our support team.">
  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <div class="contact-box">
      <p class="contact-email">
          <a href="mailto:support.styleum@sameerstudios.com">support.styleum@sameerstudios.com</a>
      </p>
      <p class="response-time">Expected response time: within 24-48 hours</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="divider"></div>
  
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>How do I add clothes to my wardrobe?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>To add clothes to your wardrobe, tap the "+" button in the app and select "Add Item" or "Take Photo". You can either take a new photo of your clothing item or select an existing photo from your camera roll. Make sure the item is well-lit and clearly visible for best results.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>How do daily outfit recommendations work?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>Styleum uses AI to analyze your wardrobe and generate personalized outfit recommendations every morning. The app considers your style preferences, the weather in your location, and the items in your wardrobe to create 4 curated looks for you to choose from. Simply open the app each morning to see your new recommendations.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>How do I use Style Me?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>Style Me is a feature that helps you create outfits on demand. Tap the "Style Me" button, and the app will generate outfit recommendations based on your current wardrobe. You can specify preferences like occasion, weather, or style, and Styleum will create personalized combinations from your existing clothes.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>What's the difference between free and Pro?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>The free version of Styleum includes basic features with limitations on wardrobe size and outfit generations. Styleum Pro unlocks unlimited wardrobe items, unlimited outfit generations, advanced styling features, and priority support. Pro subscriptions are $9.99/month and can be managed through your Apple account.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>How do I manage or cancel my subscription?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>To manage or cancel your subscription, you have two options:</p>
          <ol>
              <li>Open Styleum → Settings → Manage Subscription</li>
              <li>Go to iOS Settings → Apple ID → Subscriptions → Styleum</li>
          </ol>
          <p>Cancellation takes effect at the end of your current billing period. You'll continue to have access to Pro features until then.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>How do I restore my purchases on a new device?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>To restore your purchases on a new device, make sure you're signed in with the same Apple ID you used for your original purchase. Open Styleum and go to Settings → Restore Purchases. The app will verify your subscription status and restore your Pro access automatically.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>How do I delete my account?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>To delete your account, open Styleum and go to Profile → Settings → Delete Account. Confirm the deletion when prompted. <strong>Warning:</strong> This action is permanent and cannot be undone. All your data, including wardrobe items, outfit history, and preferences, will be permanently removed within 30 days.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>Why does the app need camera/photo access?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>Styleum needs camera and photo access to allow you to add clothing items to your wardrobe. You can take photos directly in the app or select existing photos from your library. The app only accesses photos you explicitly choose to upload. We never access your entire photo library without your permission.</p></div>
  </details>
  
  <details class="faq">
      <summary>My outfits aren't loading - what do I do?</summary>
      <div class="faq__a"><p>If your outfits aren't loading, try these troubleshooting steps:</p>
          <ol>
              <li>Check your internet connection - Styleum needs an active connection to generate outfits</li>
              <li>Close and restart the app</li>
              <li>Make sure you have items in your wardrobe - you need at least a few clothing items for outfit generation</li>
              <li>Check if you've reached your daily limit (free accounts have limits on outfit generations)</li>
              <li>If the problem persists, contact support at <a href="mailto:support.styleum@sameerstudios.com">support.styleum@sameerstudios.com</a></li>
          </ol></div>
  </details>
</DocLayout>
